From: Akshat Yadav <akshatyadav237@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] turnip: freedreno: Expose queueCount = 2 for Android HWUI

Android HWUI RenderThread asserts that VkQueueFamilyProperties queueCount
is at least 2 when initializing the Vulkan backend:
"Assertion failed: queueProps[i].queueFamilyProperties.queueCount < kRequestedQueueCount"

Expose queueCount = 2 for the graphics/compute/transfer queue family
in tu_device.cc to satisfy Android HWUI without aborting.

Signed-off-by: Akshat Yadav <akshatyadav237@gmail.com>
---
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
index 1234567..89abcdef 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
@@ -1703,7 +1703,7 @@ static const VkQueueFamilyProperties tu_queue_family_properties = {
    .queueFlags =
       VK_QUEUE_GRAPHICS_BIT | VK_QUEUE_COMPUTE_BIT | VK_QUEUE_TRANSFER_BIT,
-   .queueCount = 1,
+   .queueCount = 2,
    .timestampValidBits = 48,
    .minImageTransferGranularity = { 1, 1, 1 },
 };
